    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your Shooting phase or in the Fight phase of either player's turn. Pick one of your CHAOS KNIGHTS CHARACTER units that is not yet chosen this phase to shoot or fight, then choose an enemy unit that is a MONSTER or a VEHICLE. For the rest of the phase, whenever one of your unit's models targets that enemy unit with an attack, re-roll every Hit roll of 1 as well as every Wound roll of 1; if that target is TITANIC, any Hit roll and any Wound roll for those attacks may be re-rolled instead.",
